<header class="ref-head cty-head"><p class="cty-kicker">Country history · Oceania</p><h1 class="research-title">History of Micronesia</h1><p class="ref-lede">5 recorded states lay in what is now Micronesia, from the Saudeleur dynasty (1100 CE). 4 outside powers ruled here.</p></header>
